{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"fishy-dinky-urus","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/llm/workflow cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/criterion_preview.py:1-34` — Preserve supported criteria, timeout-to-job fallback, and atomic overlay write. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/src/configValidation.js:1-18` — Preserve fail-closed unavailable state and debounce behavior. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/src/index.js:1-22` — Preserve application purpose, save flow, and injected globals. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/src/insertionProvider.js:1-19, 34-37, 51-54` — Preserve task-type/name mapping and insertion-source contract. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/src/promptLibrary.js:1-17, 69-72` — Preserve panel responsibility, authenticated fetches, and structural-kind exception. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/src/rebarProvider.jsx:1-20, 677-723, 1041-1166, 1821-1826` — Preserve slice round-trip, unknown-key retention, validation, transient-form isolation, and read-only policy view. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/examples/review_skeleton.yaml:1-12` — Preserve retained offline four-pass example and topology. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py:1-32` — Preserve synchronous topological execution, no-scheduler tripwire, and recorder seam. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/code-review.yaml:1-15, 184-191, 244-251` — Preserve topology, escalation-cap location, standard verifier model, and provenance pass-through. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/plan-review.yaml:282-288, 308-314, 403-409, 429-435` — Preserve forward the verifier's recorded provenance without recomputing it. Consumer: not a docstring.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/plan_review_recovery.py:1-22, 101-129` — Preserve reconstruction responsibility, lazy patch seam, and metrics derivation. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check